<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>The Complete AI Playbook</title>
<style>
  @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,700;12..96,800&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap');

  :root {
    --primary: #7B3FF2;
    --background: #FAF8FC;
    --secondary: #1E1830;
    --accent: #0F9B8A;
    
    --font-heading: 'Bricolage Grotesque', 'Space Grotesk', 'Syne', 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
    --font-body: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', 'Inter', 'Manrope', 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
  }

  * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }

  body {
    background-color: #E2DFE8;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    padding: 24px;
  }

  .card {
    background-color: var(--background);
    color: var(--secondary);
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 600px;
    border-radius: 20px;
    padding: 36px;
    box-shadow: 0 16px 40px rgba(30, 24, 48, 0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 28px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(30, 24, 48, 0.08);
  }

  /* Header Bar */
  .header {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-bottom: 16px;
    border-bottom: 1.5px solid rgba(30, 24, 48, 0.12);
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .header-left {
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .header-right {
    color: var(--primary);
  }

  /* Title Section */
  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-size: 2.3rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    line-height: 1.15;
    text-align: center;
    color: var(--secondary);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  /* SVG Graphic */
  .graphic-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 8px 0;
  }

  .graphic-svg {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 320px;
    height: auto;
  }

  /* List Items */
  .list-container {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .list-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
  }

  .badge {
    background-color: var(--accent);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    width: 36px;
    height: 36px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .item-text {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--secondary);
    line-height: 1.3;
  }

  .item-text strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: 0.01em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .item-text span {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 400;
    color: rgba(30, 24, 48, 0.8);
  }

  /* Footer Bar */
  .footer {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding-top: 20px;
    border-top: 1.5px solid rgba(30, 24, 48, 0.12);
    font-size: 1.05rem;
  }

  .cta {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }

  .cta strong {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .brand-logo {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
  }

  .logo-icon {
    background-color: var(--primary);
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    width: 40px;
    height: 40px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }

  .logo-text {
    font-family: var(--font-heading);
    font-weight: 800;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    line-height: 1.1;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--secondary);
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <!-- Header -->
    <div class="header">
      <span class="header-left">Practical AI Education • Sheva Studio</span>
      <span class="header-right">Sheva Studio</span>
    </div>

    <!-- Title -->
    <h1 class="title">The Complete AI Playbook:<br>From Setup to Flow</h1>

    <!-- Isometric Graphic Visual -->
    <div class="graphic-container">
      <svg class="graphic-svg" viewBox="0 0 300 200" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
        <!-- Isometric Base Screen -->
        <path d="M150 20 L270 80 L150 140 L30 80 Z" fill="#7B3FF2" fill-opacity="0.1" stroke="#7B3FF2" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round"/>
        <path d="M30 80 L30 95 L150 155 L270 95 L270 80" stroke="#7B3FF2" stroke-width="3" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/>
        
        <!-- Bar Charts on Isometric Base -->
        <rect x="180" y="55" width="14" height="40" rx="3" fill="#7B3FF2" transform="rotate(-30 180 55) skewX(30)"/>
        <rect x="205" y="45" width="14" height="55" rx="3" fill="#0F9B8A" transform="rotate(-30 205 45) skewX(30)"/>
        <rect x="230" y="35" width="14" height="70" rx="3" fill="#7B3FF2" fill-opacity="0.4" transform="rotate(-30 230 35) skewX(30)"/>
        
        <!-- Central Processing Block -->
        <path d="M150 80 L180 95 L150 110 L120 95 Z" fill="#7B3FF2" stroke="#1E1830" stroke-width="2"/>
        <path d="M120 95 L120 105 L150 120 L180 105 L180 95" fill="#1E1830" stroke="#1E1830" stroke-width="2"/>
        
        <!-- Lightbulb Element -->
        <circle cx="150" cy="45" r="14" fill="#0F9B8A"/>
        <path d="M150 37 L150 53 M142 45 L158 45" stroke="#FAF8FC" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round"/>
      </svg>
    </div>

    <!-- Numbered Points -->
    <div class="list-container">
      <div class="list-item">
        <div class="badge">1</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <strong>Start with what you have</strong> <span>(ChatGPT, Gemini, Copilot)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="list-item">
        <div class="badge">2</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <strong>Delegate routine tasks</strong> <span>(emails / drafts / summaries)</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="list-item">
        <div class="badge">3</div>
        <div class="item-text">
          <strong>Build human-AI workflows</strong> <span>(review &amp; verify)</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Footer -->
    <div class="footer">
      <div class="cta">
        Watch &rarr; <strong>YouTube: @sheva.studio</strong>
      </div>
      <div class="brand-logo">
        <div class="logo-icon">S</div>
        <div class="logo-text">
          Sheva<br>Studio
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</body>
</html>
